  description: Lord Cornelius Of the Floating Realm is the heir of two Noblesse families.
    His enemies call him the bastard of the Sharks and the Octopuses. Being impure,
    it was not intended for him to receive the Noblesse title, but all the other
    heirs mysteriously stepped back or died in strange circumstances...
